ΓΕΝΕΘΛΙΟΛΟΓΙΟ / BIRTHDAY CALENDAR — PROPRIETARY LICENCE

Copyright (c) 2026 Ioannis Kalaitzidis. All rights reserved.

This repository contains the complete source code of a personal web
application that stores birthdays and sends email reminders — the React
front end, the serverless functions, the SQL schema and migrations, the
configuration and build files, and the accompanying documentation.

Publishing this repository does not place any of it in the public domain and
does not grant any licence beyond what is stated below.


