────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CONFIGURATION AND CREDENTIALS
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

No API keys, database credentials or other secrets are contained in this
repository. Every such value is supplied at runtime through environment
variables and is deliberately excluded from version control.

Any credentials used by a deployment of this software belong to the person who
created them and are not covered by any permission granted above.


────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PERSONAL DATA
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This application, when deployed, stores personal data about third parties:
names, dates of birth and, optionally, email addresses of people who are not
users of the application and who have not necessarily consented to it.

Whoever deploys and operates an instance of this software is the data
controller for the information it holds, and is solely responsible for
complying with the General Data Protection Regulation and any other applicable
data-protection law — including lawful basis, retention, and the rights of the
people whose birthdays are recorded.

The author of this software is not the controller or processor of data held in
any deployment other than his own.


